er-purple-500/50 transition duration-300\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-purple-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3\">10 VIP Trip Quotas</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Generate 10 full premium itineraries for free. Use our advanced AI to map out your video locations in seconds.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-stone-200 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:border-purple-500/50 transition duration-300\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-pink-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-pink-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-share-2\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"/><line x1=\"8.59\" x2=\"15.42\" y1=\"13.51\" y2=\"17.49\"/><line x1=\"15.41\" x2=\"8.59\" y1=\"6.51\" y2=\"10.49\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3\">Shareable Links</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Don\"t just tell them where you went. Give your viewers a clickable, interactive map of your entire trip.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-stone-200 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:border-purple-500/50 transition duration-300\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-blue-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"